{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226530","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226530","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1222653001:1":{"text":"别看我这样，我早就和水鬼帮说永别了，目前是个正经的船工。","source_cn":"别看我这样，我早就和水鬼帮说永别了，目前是个正经的船工。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C375C84673687BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222653002:1":{"text":"我偶尔也会跟黑市做点生意，那天，有个女的来找我，她鬼鬼祟祟的，肯定有问题。","source_cn":"我偶尔也会跟黑市做点生意，那天，有个女的来找我，她鬼鬼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5465B7AAF3231310","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222653003:1":{"text":"她穿得很破，不像是有钱的样子，她想买船，托我给她找关系。","source_cn":"她穿得很破，不像是有钱的样子，她想买船，托我给她找关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7FB968E1305FFD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222653004:1":{"text":"但我知道最近管得严，黑白两边都有人放话，禁止任何船只交易。","source_cn":"但我知道最近管得严，黑白两边都有人放话，禁止任何船只交易。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60AEE29B0D8F0A8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222653005:1":{"text":"没挣到那女人的钱，总得让我挣一笔血薇帮的赏金吧，所以我就过来举报了。","source_cn":"没挣到那女人的钱，总得让我挣一笔血薇帮的赏金吧，所以我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6008403850244CEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222653006:1":{"text":"大致情况我了解了，但是还得仔细问问清楚。","source_cn":"大致情况我了解了，但是还得仔细问问清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03141CE5262C3B27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222653007:1":{"text":"我敢确定，买船的那个女人绝对是通缉犯！","source_cn":"我敢确定，买船的那个女人绝对是通缉犯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB400602783FE7905","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1222653007":{"text":"我敢确定，买船的那个女人绝对是通缉犯！","source_cn":"我敢确定，买船的那个女人绝对是通缉犯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB400602783FE7905","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222653008:1":{"text":"也不能这么说，不少人还是会买的……呃，我是说，你说得对，确实！","source_cn":"也不能这么说，不少人还是会买的……呃，我是说，你说得对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43DB0FD16153D364","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222653010:1":{"text":"那个女人说话的语气神秘兮兮，一看就是心怀不轨。","source_cn":"那个女人说话的语气神秘兮兮，一看就是心怀不轨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x392BD800F11B3843","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1222653010":{"t